    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks. One thing that's bothering me is the pattern of the cracks. They seem almost localized to certain spots, even though the thermal stress should be more uniform across the whole stretch. Could there be anything else happening with the subgrade or the compaction levels that would cause these irregular patterns rather than a consistent crack along the joint?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
